### ========== 주문 API ==========

### 주문 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: nahyeon
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Hx7!mK2@

{
  "items": [
    {"productId": 1, "quantity": 2},
    {"productId": 2, "quantity": 1}
  ],
  "addressId": 1,
  "ordererPhone": "010-1234-5678"
}

### 장바구니 기반 주문 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: nahyeon
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Hx7!mK2@

{
  "cartItemIds": [1, 2],
  "addressId": 1,
  "ordererPhone": "010-1234-5678"
}

### 주문 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
X-Loopers-LoginId: nahyeon
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Hx7!mK2@

### 주문 목록 조회 (날짜 범위)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders?startAt=2026-01-01T00:00:00+09:00&endAt=2026-12-31T23:59:59+09:00
X-Loopers-LoginId: nahyeon
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Hx7!mK2@

### 주문 상세 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/1
X-Loopers-LoginId: nahyeon
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Hx7!mK2@

### 주문 취소
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/1
X-Loopers-LoginId: nahyeon
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Hx7!mK2@
